

### Get all organizations and available terms (replicate SimpleSyllabusApi.get_organizations & get_available_terms)
### Extracts organizations and terms from app-state nested in response
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/app-state?locale=en-US
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0)


### Get syllabi metadata list by organization (replicate SimpleSyllabusApi.fetch_syllabi_metadata_list_by_org)
### Required params: organization_id, page (0-based), term_statuses[] (or defaults to ["future"])
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/doc-library-search?page=0&term_statuses[]=future
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0)


### Get syllabi by organization with term_id override
### When syncing specific term, pass term_id and override term_statuses with empty array
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/doc-library-search?organization_id=ORG_ID&term_id=TERM_ID&page=0
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0)


### Get syllabi by editor (alternative path)
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/doc-library-search?editor=EMAIL@EXAMPLE.COM&page=0&term_statuses[]=future
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0)


### Get syllabi detail page (replicate SimpleSyllabusApi.fetch_syllabus_detail)
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/doc-full-page-get?code=SYLLABUS_CODE
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0)


### Example: Fetch specific syllabus by code
GET https://snow.simplesyllabus.com/api2/doc-full-page-get?code=3rpi2fdwv
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; SnowSeTools/1.0) 